cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "OpenRouter Uptime: an independent availability and data-policy registry for OpenRouter models"
abstract: >-
  An independent, git-timestamped registry of model and routing-endpoint
  availability exposed by OpenRouter's public API, together with each provider's
  data policy (training, prompt retention, terms of service). Raw API
  responses are archived as ground truth; tidy tables are mirrored to HuggingFace
  and Kaggle.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Wenbin
    family-names: Wu
repository-code: "https://github.com/dthinkr/openrouter-uptime"
url: "https://github.com/dthinkr/openrouter-uptime"
keywords:
  - openrouter
  - large language models
  - uptime
  - infrastructure
  - AI governance
  - time series
